WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:06.500
A live guide runs every component, with its code beside it

00:06.500 --> 00:13.500
Orbit: a real dashboard built only from the library

00:13.500 --> 00:20.000
Pick a filter and the table keeps only the failing project

00:20.000 --> 00:26.500
Light and dark themes repaint every component

00:26.500 --> 00:31.500
Change the accent colour and the whole guide follows

00:31.500 --> 00:37.000
Press / to search, then open a component

00:37.000 --> 00:42.500
Arrow keys move between tabs, as in every widget here

00:42.500 --> 00:50.000
Open the component's code and copy it into your app

00:50.000 --> 00:57.500
Install the library with one command
